---
---

<section class="relative flex min-h-[100svh] items-end overflow-hidden bg-roast">
    <img
        src="/images/inesita/real/latte-art-tosta.jpg"
        alt="Latte art y tosta de Inesita"
        class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover"
    />
    <div
        class="absolute inset-0"
        style="background:
            radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 60% at 20% 15%, rgba(139,26,26,0.25), transparent 60%),
            linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(41,38,34,0.55) 0%, rgba(28,26,23,0.75) 55%, rgba(16,15,13,0.92) 100%);"
    >
    </div>

    <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-6 pb-16 pt-40 sm:pb-20 lg:px-12 lg:pb-24">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-parchment/60">
            <span>Café de especialidad · Ourense</span>
            <span class="hidden sm:inline">Av. de la Habana, 54</span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="heading-display mt-6 text-heading-lg text-parchment sm:text-display">Inesita</h1>

        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-8 sm:flex-row sm:items-end sm:justify-between">
            <p class="max-w-md font-sans text-base leading-relaxed text-parchment/75 sm:text-lg">
                Grano de especialidad tostado con mimo, dulce de casa y un rincón tranquilo en Ourense para el café de cada día — o el de una ocasión especial.
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
                <a href="#carta" class="btn-ghost btn-ghost-dark">Ver la carta</a>
                <a href="#eventos" class="btn-ghost text-parchment/90 border-parchment/40 hover:border-parchment hover:bg-transparent hover:text-parchment">
                    Eventos y celebraciones
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
